Question. 7 Write a query to find the employee ID, job title, number of days between ending date and starting date for all jobs in department 90.

SELECT 
    h.employee_id, 
    j.job_title, 
    DATEDIFF(h.end_date, h.start_date) AS no_of_days 
FROM job_history h 
JOIN jobs j 
    ON h.job_id = j.job_id 
WHERE h.department_id = 90;
